Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.53,0:00:03.23,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,This is Kobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.17,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,It's so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.17,0:00:07.63,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh man, my first time \Nin Kansai! I'm pumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:10.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All right. Next stop, my house, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:12.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's with those faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:15.54,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Obviously, we're gonna see the sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What, seriously? Isn't it hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.10,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What do you think, Yoi-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:22.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll go along with \Nwhatever you guys decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.04,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,All right! Sightseeing it is, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.59,Default,EVERYONE,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:59.51,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H617A83&\3c&H7D3F17&\pos(316.667,107.333)\frx26\fry0}Hyogo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:59.51,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H5D6981&\3c&H4E3443&\frx26\fry0\pos(320,214)}Nankinmachi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.29,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,That looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:04.96,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,There's a panda one, too! So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.08,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Wanna get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll pass. I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry either, so I'll wait, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:13.97,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Okay, then we'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:17.03,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I wonder what's in the panda one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:17.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,They're sure full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:22.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, it sure is hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.81,0:02:24.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:27.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I naturally run hot, \Nso I can't stand this weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:29.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:35.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,If you'd like, you can \Njoin me under the parasol?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:36.88,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Does that keep you cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:38.84,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:40.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:53.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's a bit cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:03:00.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-This doesn't make it cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.25,0:03:02.36,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is he doing this on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:05.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that you even \Nbrought your parasol with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:10.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,When I stand in the sun too long,\Nmy skin turns bright red.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:13.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You do have fair skin, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.01,0:03:16.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay \Nstaying behind, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:19.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We came all the way to Chinatown...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:22.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:27.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't care what we do, \Nas long as I get to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:29.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:31.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want to flirt with you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.61,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:41.32,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,We went and bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:43.50,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:44.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:48.11,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey! That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:49.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.08,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai is a little different \Nfrom his usual self today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:57.35,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The clothes I bought and \Nthe earrings, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have worn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:04.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The two of us should have \Njust come on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:07.86,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:13.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Anyway, just have a seat wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:17.45,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,W-Wow! This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:18.67,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, man, amazing! Thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.66,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Is your boyfriend's family an oil tycoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:21.40,top,SHUN,0,0,0,,Your house is amazing, but \Nthis is really something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:21.40,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:23.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is anyone hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm about to order. \NWhat do you guys want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.55,0:04:26.12,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.53,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Since we have the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.97,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,I'd like to watch something \Nwhile we eat pizza and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:36.81,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,A slingshot isn't going to cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:38.47,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Millie, please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:39.72,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, you want me to spoil it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:42.08,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.80,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Everyone, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:46.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Does anyone want something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.71,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:49.62,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.33,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.34,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Me, too. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:52.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:54.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I could get it my—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.78,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's all right, I'll get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Tea okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes, sorry to trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:04.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:09.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He sort of mentioned how he keeps \Nthe location of his house a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:16.94,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Was it really okay for me to ask him \Nto bring my friends here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:23.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, are we really gonna end up \Nwatching this til season two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be faster if I just\Nspoiled it for you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.08,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Like I said, don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:34.32,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey! They're flirting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:35.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:37.64,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,That's shameless, {\i1}shameless{\i0} I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm just sitting next to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I think I'm doing great\Nat containing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:43.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Anyway, look, Millie's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:44.40,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:48.25,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Ah! Why is Millie the \Nonly one with powers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.77,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.26,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:50.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He is just sitting next to me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:51.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?! Oh, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:58.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,want to hang out tonight.\N Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:12.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:19.48,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I said, "Okay," without giving \Nit much thought, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:22.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It'll be all right... Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.92,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And, well...\NI want to flirt with you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.40,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No, that can't be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:30.36,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:33.58,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't care what we do, \Nas long as I get to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just... how do I put it...
