Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:55.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... I'm still awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:08.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:13.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai... just got out of the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, they're already asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:20.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,How about your friends, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa's already asleep, but Sentaro \Nis playing games in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:28.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I told him I was going to \Nshower and forced my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:36.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, Senpai, did you have fun today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Why d'you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:42.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, you let my friends \Ncome along because I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:48.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But maybe our first summer break together\Nshould have been just us, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:49.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You taking this too seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:50.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry \Nabout things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:57.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We won't get many chances like this,\N and it's been pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's kinda like a school trip, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:10.88,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We won't be going on our school trip \Nor graduating in the same year...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.84,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:16.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But, well, to be honest,\Nif it was just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,we could've flirted a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm telling you right now,\Nthere will be {\i1}none{\i0} of that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:25.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Even holding hands?\NNot even a hug? Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:25.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:28.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're... serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:34.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean, don't you think you're a little \Nexcessive with physical contact, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:36.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,In various ways...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's because.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,If you like someone, isn't it\N normal to want to touch them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:47.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:49.21,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I won't deny that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:56.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,are you always like this \Nwhen you date a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:08:59.94,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.68,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Must have been my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:04.64,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:06.60,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,There's pizza left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:09.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why do we have to hide?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:12.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,'Cause it'll be a pain\N if he goes off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:16.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But it doesn't mean he had to \Ngo right from that to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.23,0:09:18.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't know any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:26.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Up until now... I thought dating just \Nmeant sticking together and making out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:29.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I thought that's what it \Nmeant to be in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:32.13,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,When it comes to you, Yoi-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:37.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,as much as I want you and \Nwant to get to know you more...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:38.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I also want to cherish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:43.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I have these conflicting feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:45.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:49.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't know any other way to express \Nmy feelings other than by "touching,"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:52.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,so sometimes I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:53.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I sorta...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,don't even know what I'm saying anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:03.12,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-Who even is this awkward person?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:06.55,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't care what we do, \Nas long as I get to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:10.22,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's the same feeling as \Nwhen I heard those words...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:13.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This feeling that bubbles \Nup inside my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:16.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just what do you call this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.52,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Mi amore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:37.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:39.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,If you'd like...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:43.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Before we leave tomorrow, \Nwe could go someplace together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:47.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,L-Like... on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:51.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:53.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,W-Well then, I guess we \Nshould head to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:00.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.99,0:11:03.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,For tomorrow... Is ten too early?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:04.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then let's meet in the living room at ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:08.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,G-Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:24.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:26.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:29.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,May I please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:31.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,have a goodnight hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You messing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Besides, you're the one \Nwho said it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sayin' there'd be none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:48.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I feel like I kinda understand \Nwhat you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:52.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I want to cherish you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:54.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but I want to touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:59.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's why, right now,\NI want to touch you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're killin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:09.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:41.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, man, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What am I... What am I even doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:45.89,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't stay calm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:48.24,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it is embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:49.64,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's body temperature... \NThe feel of his arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:56.55,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The smell of his shampoo, his breathing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:59.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,All of it, all of it, all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.41,0:13:02.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,is ruminating in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm losing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:11.52,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, did you just get out of the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:14.17,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Gotta say, that was awfully long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.35,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Who are you, Shizuka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:19.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:21.08,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:25.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just what do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:29.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,call this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.16,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha, what? What? What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:42.60,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,My glasses, glasses...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:42.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:47.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Actually, I have something I need \Nto talk to you guys about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:55.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:59.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:03.40,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It took a bit longer \Nthan I thought, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:10.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoi-chan, you seem a \Nbit sparkly today, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean by that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:16.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:19.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, actually never mind. \NDon't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go before it gets hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:29.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I actually had Nobara and Kotobuki \Ndo a few things for me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:33.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wanted a little more of\N a reaction... I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:35.63,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Did Ichi leave already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:36.70,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:39.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Damn it, they're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:39.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:45.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't want them to see \Nhow you look today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:51.41,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:54.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,that I'll take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:56.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:00.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:02.89,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's making me dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:11.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What a beautiful aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I did a little research last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:22.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:25.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I would like to hold your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:26.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:33.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,One vote... in favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:55.05,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs9.5\c&H866370&\pos(360.667,229.333)}Koi Food
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:16.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's good, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:28.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, this is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:31.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,A gift for your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:32.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's for my big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:34.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What, you have a big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:35.84,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord1\fs8\c&H6C94A5&\3c&HCEF0FD&\frz4.049\pos(520.666,50.667)}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:35.84,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:37.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you want to see a pic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.59,0:16:40.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh, you guys don't look much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:44.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Unlike me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:50.04,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,My big sister looks very girly, \Nso she's always been popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:55.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,During my first year of junior high,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:16:57.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,there was a boy I had a \Nlittle crush on and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:01.03,flashback,BOY B,0,0,0,,Hey, I wonder if Takiguchi \Nhas a crush on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:03.01,flashback,BOY C,0,0,0,,What are ya gonna do if \Nshe confesses to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:04.16,flashback,BOY A,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:07.99,flashback,BOY A,0,0,0,,There's no way I can date a \Ngirl who's taller than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:11.25,flashback,BOY A,0,0,0,,Would've been better if it was \Nher big sis instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Where does he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's his high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:16.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.53,top,YOI,0,0,0,,P-Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:16.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Elementary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:18.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What ward, what block, \Nwhat building, what number?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:18.80,top,YOI,0,0,0,,It's all in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:20.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm {\i1}gonna{\i0} find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:21.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:25.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I think that's when I sort of started \Nto have trouble talking to guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:31.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, but I do love my big sis, so I'm \Nhonestly happy when she gets praised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:33.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:37.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, that's the cause of \Nyour low self-esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Can you show me your sis one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:42.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:46.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:50.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Well, your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:54.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you have any siblings, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I do. One older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:00.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:02.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He's a fine young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:05.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,A steady, honest, upstanding citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:08.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What? I kind of... can't picture that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He {\i1}is{\i0} the total opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Dunno where he is or what \Nhe's doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:16.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:19.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Some things happened\Nbetween him and his ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:21.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He fought with our parents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:22.78,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Haven't heard from him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:25.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:29.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Life's full of surprises, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:39.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He made it sound like nothing, but \Nthat's not a common situation at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:48.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why was he talking about his own family\N like it was someone else's problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:02.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:06.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You should've said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:10.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:13.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Those people you were with just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:16.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, I just picked up a \Ncellphone they dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:23.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh, could it be that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:24.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,you're jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:27.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:29.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:33.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Yoi-san, I was just kiddin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:38.28,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Why am I always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:39.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoa, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:41.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:43.20,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:46.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? Still sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:47.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I am certainly—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:49.38,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,not... sulking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:51.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Really. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:54.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm disgusted with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:01.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We were just having a serious \Nconversation about your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:03.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but then seeing you with other girls \Nquickly made me lose my confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:06.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and on top of that, I became \Ncompletely preoccupied with myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:08.10,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh, wordy much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.54,0:20:09.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and as if that wasn't enough, I ended \Nup making you have to cheer me up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:12.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I should have just admitted I was jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:16.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But instead, I ended up thinking\N those girls would suit you better
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:21.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,than someone who's putting in all her\N effort just to wear a dress for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:23.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.87,0:20:28.55,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I really do have low self-esteem, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:29.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know how you don't look\Nat me as the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:37.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You've treated me as one of \Nthe guys right from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:41.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you just \Ndidn't like me at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:47.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But... I feel like I can be myself \Nwhen I'm with you, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:50.36,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Laughing at stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:52.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Holding hands while we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:57.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Eating gyoza, eating dango, and \Ntalking side-by-side at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:00.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously, just being with you is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:03.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,When I saw my bro broken, \NI honestly thought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,"He's so lame for feeling broken \Nover something silly like love."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:10.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But now, I'm thinking that \Nlove is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:14.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Talk about your teenage cliché, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:22.59,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd ever dress like this \Nfor someone and go on a date, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:24.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:25.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I chose these earrings,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:30.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,because I thought they looked similar \Nto yours and we could match.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:32.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I thought that might be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:51.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We should head back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:53.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:59.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to end up \Nloving him more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.57,0:22:09.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,You could have...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:13.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,kissed me, y'know.
